{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短时段的静态感受词过于密集，部分意象重复解释同一种感觉，容易让观众来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点放大的词露出每段叙事骨架，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住人物当下的处境；感受与音乐节点对应，也让情绪变化有了具体的发生过程，而不只是事后贴上几个情绪标签。尤其在S06—S14，人物从害怕暴露、渴望互相依靠，到接受不确定性、不再隐藏喜欢，心理变化的层次和前后联系都比较清楚。X的优势是文字相对克制、因果叙述直接，但感受描述较多停留在概括性情绪，音乐中的细微变化没有像Y那样转化为可感知的具体体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89ceacc3-47ff-485d-aa14-7307f848b250", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061226799015Z", "elapsed_seconds": 160.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:15:07.374262+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f442f02a64c67a5449c21c83b1b9faab1a7454a0768a1c2f4c95e24b414f811f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\